[{"id":1786372299239,"text":"既然是打错字，那爸爸就勉强原谅你这一次。","rawContent":"既然是打错字，那爸爸就勉强原谅你这一次。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:04","timestamp":1786374249037,"roundId":"round_1786374225163_nsfwu5wq0","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":22285},{"id":1786372299240,"text":"不过，这句‘爸爸别停’，叫得倒是挺乖。","rawContent":"不过，这句‘爸爸别停’，叫得倒是挺乖。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:04","timestamp":1786374249087,"roundId":"round_1786374225163_nsfwu5wq0","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":22286},{"id":1786372299241,"text":"是不是刚才爸爸停下来盘问你的时候，里面的水流得更多了？","rawContent":"是不是刚才爸爸停下来盘问你的时候，里面的水流得更多了？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:04","timestamp":1786374249088,"roundId":"round_1786374225163_nsfwu5wq0","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":22287},{"id":1786372299242,"text":"空虚得难受，夹着空气，就等着爸爸的手指重新顶进去是不是？","rawContent":"空虚得难受，夹着空气，就等着爸爸的手指重新顶进去是不是？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:04","timestamp":1786374249681,"roundId":"round_1786374225163_nsfwu5wq0","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":22288},{"id":1786372299243,"text":"既然求爸爸别停，那就乖乖把腿再张开一点。","rawContent":"既然求爸爸别停，那就乖乖把腿再张开一点。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:04","timestamp":1786374249833,"roundId":"round_1786374225163_nsfwu5wq0","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":22289},{"id":1786372299244,"text":"刚才爸爸的手指停在哪里了？是不是正好压在那块最酸的软肉上？","rawContent":"刚才爸爸的手指停在哪里了？是不是正好压在那块最酸的软肉上？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"23:04","